<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: Sheesh, ain’t often we get a\nchallenger from Johto.\rI’m Brock, Pewter Block Boss. Rock\nhomie expert. Rock ENTHUSIAST.\rMy homies don’t feel most physical\nhits. They too hard. Like my heart\fafter Jenny.\rYou gon’ have a HARD time doin’\ndamage. C’mon!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: Your homies broke through my\nrock-hard defense...\rLike the last ten girls I asked out.\rYou stronger than I expected...\fGo ’head--take this Chain.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Boulder Chain from Brock!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: I deadass enjoyed scrappin’\nwith you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI’ll give you the move Brick Wall too.\rIt can make the other homie\nflinch sometimes.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: I deadass enjoyed scrappin’\nwith you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI’ll give you the move Brick Wall too.\rIt can make the other homie\nflinch sometimes.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock: The world HUGE. There’s mad\nstrong Hustlers like you.\rJust wait. I’m finna get stronger\ntoo. And find love. One of them two.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future legend! You look...\fDEADASS rockin’.\rYou scrappin’ Kanto’s Block Bosses?\rThey strong and dedicated, just like\nJohto’s. And they all single. Weird.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future legend! That Block ain’t\ngive you NO trouble.\rThe way you took charge was REAL\ninspirin’. I mean that. I’m takin’\fnotes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pewter City Block\nIt’s Rocks. Just Rocks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0462_T03GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pewter City Block\rBoss: Brock\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
